abstract: >-
  Quarterly median sale prices of houses and apartments for every Belgian
  municipality (INS/NIS code), Q1 2010 to Q1 2026, in long CSV format.
  Medians as published by Statbel (FPS Economy, Directorate-General
  Statistics - Statistics Belgium) and reshaped by Levier. Snapshot of
  8 October 2026: 22,991 data rows, 437 INS codes, 65 quarters.
  SHA-256 of the CSV: c832122d75bce06e258a409f79982c617e0755d3a265c3ebf4be004c5022b79a.
